Subject: [PATCH 21/22] test-posix: Check <uchar.h> and the char16_t and
 char32_t conversions

The types and prototypes, no plain parameter names and no C23 char8_t
functions in strict C17 mode; mbrtoc16, c16rtomb, mbrtoc32 and
c32rtomb with null arguments, surrogate pairs, encoding errors and
their own internal states.
